{'symbol': 'PHM', 'date': '2022-01-26 12:37:00', 'title': 'THE PULTE FAMILY PUBLISHES BOOK OF PULTEGROUP FOUNDER WILLIAM J. "BILL" PULTE (PHM:NYSE) AND GRANDSON WILLIAM J.', 'text': 'BOCA RATON, FLA., JAN. 26, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE PULTE FAMILY IS PLEASED TO ANNOUNCE THE PUBLISHING OF ITS BOOK ON BILL PULTE, CALLED "THE HOME THAT BILL PULTE BUILT", WHICH REVEALS AN INSIDE LOOK INTO BILLIONAIRE AND PULTEGROUP (PHM:NYSE) FOUNDER WILLIAM J.'}